   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": 1
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = u'(v(x)) \\cdot v'(x) \\). From the table, \\( v(1) = 2 \\), so the outer derivative is read in the row x = 2: \\( u'(2) = -1 \\).",
         "rule_named": "chain rule"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "So \\( -1 = h'(1) = \\left(-1\\right) \\cdot v'(1) \\), and \\( v'(1) = 1 \\).",
         "mathjson": 1,
         "rule_named": "solve for the missing factor"
      }
   ],
